Once [[Link]] has completed one of the four "[[Regional Phenomena]]" [[Main Quest]]s and repaired [[Robbie]]'s [[Hot-Air Balloon]] during "[[A Mystery in the Depths]]", Robbie will go back to the Hateno Ancient Tech Lab. Before he leaves, he will ask Link to visit him there so he can upgrade the [[Purah Pad]].<ref name="TotK Robbie"/><ref name="TotK Robbie 2"/>

After collecting data from five types of monsters and upgrading to "[[Sensor +]]", Link will be able to purchase [[Hyrule Compendium]] [[Picture]]s from Robbie.<ref name="TotK Robbie 3"/>

