==Trivia==
* The messy design of the Hateno Ancient Tech Lab is meant to be a reflection of Purah's personality.<ref name="CaC 271"/>
* The Hateno Ancient Tech Lab contains several examples of [[Hylian (Language)|Hylian]] and [[Sheikah (Language)|Sheikah]] text.
** The [[Sign]]s on the path to the Hateno Ancient Tech Lab translate to "Ancient laboratory."<ref>{{Cite|{{Script|Hylian BotW|Ancient laboratory}}|N/A|BotW}}</ref>
** The sign above the entrance translates to "Laboratory."<ref>{{Cite|{{Script|Hylian BotW|Laboratory}}|N/A|BotW}}</ref>
** The text on the back archway, Purah's desk chair, and above the door to Purah's Room translates to "Director."<ref name="Director">{{Cite|{{Script|Hylian BotW|Director}}|N/A|BotW}}</ref>
** The chalk lines on the floor translate to "Director" and "Famulus".<ref name="Director"/><ref>{{Cite|{{Script|Hylian BotW|Famulus}}|N/A|BotW}}</ref>
** The rails near the Guidance Stone have Sheikah text that translates to "Shutter."<ref>{{Cite|{{Script|Sheikah|SHUTTER}}|N/A|BotW}}</ref>

